      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 455.92,
        "r": 548.6000100000001,
        "b": 408.33
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: Take note of all empty connectors on the formatter before disconnecting any wire harnesses or flat-flexible cables (FFCs). Some empty connectors might not be visible until other items -like the hard-disk drive-are removed, so pay close attention while removing the formatter and accessories items.",
      "section_id": "sec_6",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 1,
      "section_path": [
